OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,FProtesters gathered in Newton Abbot on
OL,8,FTuesday 4 August as a public inquiry
OL,9,Fbegan into controversial plans to
OL,10,Fbuild 1,200 homes near a 2,000-year-
OL,11,Fold wetland.
OL,13,FDeveloper Vistry was given outline
OL,14,Fpermission for the development at
OL,15,FWolborough Fen near Newton Abbot, but
OL,16,Fthe Devon Wildlife Trust and many
OL,17,Flocal people say it will damage the
OL,18,Farea.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
