OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,FVistry says it welcomes the inquiry
OL,8,Fand wants to deliver "affordable homes
OL,9,Fand community facilities" whilst
OL,10,Fprotecting the environment.
OL,12,FThe inquiry will look at whether the
OL,13,Fdevelopers have taken steps to meet
OL,14,Fplanning conditions and prevent damage
OL,15,Fto the fen.
OL,17,FSpeaking outside Teignbridge District
OL,18,FCouncil's headquarters on Tuesday
OL,19,Fmorning, protesters told ITV West
OL,20,FCountry they wanted to save the fen
OL,21,Ffrom potential damage.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,FKate Van Dyke said: "We've just been
OL,8,Fhorrified about how this has all
OL,9,Fplayed out.
OL,11,F"The fen is thousands of years old.
OL,12,FHaving sustained itself for thousands
OL,13,Fof years, being suddenly under threat,
OL,14,Fit's incredulous really.
OL,16,F"We object to the massive scale of
OL,17,Fthis huge development. It is not
OL,18,Fwanted by Newton Abbot.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,F"Newton Abbot has had huge amount of
OL,8,Fdevelopment over the last decade. We
OL,9,Fdon't have the infrastructure. We
OL,10,Fdon't have the hospital spaces. So
OL,11,Fwe're just trying to protect the
OL,12,Fbeautiful town."
OL,14,FKirk Field added: "We are hoping for
OL,15,Fsome common sense and some
OL,16,Fconsideration for nature.
OL,18,F"It's just it's more than 'Nimby'. And
OL,19,Fit's not just a case of wanting to
OL,20,Fstop houses being built on green
OL,21,Ffields.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,F"There are houses that need to be
OL,8,Fbuilt and green fields that needs to
OL,9,Fbe lost, but not the fen."
OL,11,FRichard Dawes, independent councillor
OL,12,Fon Teignbridge District Council, said:
OL,13,F"The strength of feeling is very
OL,14,Fstrong. This planning application has
OL,15,Fbeen rumbling on for 15 years.
OL,17,F"Outline planning permission was
OL,18,Fgranted, which was accepted, but only
OL,19,Fif the developer could ensure that
OL,20,Fthere was no harm (to the fen).
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,F"That has not been demonstrated to any
OL,8,Fgood level as yet. "
OL,10,FPeter Sadler, divisional managing
OL,11,Fdirector at Vistry, said: "We strongly
OL,12,Fwelcome the inquiry, which will ensure
OL,13,Fa transparent and rigorous examination
OL,14,Fof the issues and allow all the
OL,15,Ftechnical evidence to be considered in
OL,16,Ffull.
OL,26,@sD@[OU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1786020503
OL,3,C'Horrified' protesters fight to save
OL,4,CDevon wetland as planning inquiry
OL,5,Cbegins
OL,7,F"Our Phase 2A development does not
OL,8,Fencroach on the Wolborough Fen
OL,9,Fcatchment area, and Natural England
OL,10,Fhave confirmed on multiple occasions
OL,11,Fthat they have no objection to the
OL,12,Fdevelopment proceeding.
OL,14,F"Our aim remains to deliver much-
OL,15,Fneeded affordable homes and community
OL,16,Ffacilities for local people while
OL,17,Fprotecting the environment.
OL,19,F"We hope the inquiry provides a clear
OL,20,Fway forward so we can progress the
OL,21,Fdevelopment."
OL,26,@}D@MO]
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
